                              MEDITATIONS ON FAVOUR

Preface

For his anger endures but a moment; in his favour is life . . . (Ps
30:5). If life is in his favour, then lack of favour is death. A life
without favour is a hard, cursed and death-filled life. Living in
God’s favour is the only way to life. Everything you need is
encompassed and available in the favour of God. This is the
reason you must strongly desire the mantle of favour to be
upon your life.
The things of the spirit are not accidental. Thus, the grace for
favour needs to be intentionally engaged. One way to trigger
the operation of favour on your life is to create it by the same
power that created the heavens and the earth. This scriptures
on favour are to be constantly and routinely declared unto you
see the manifestation of favour in your life. Do well to find a
suitable atmosphere and engage effectively, repeatedly,
continually and routinely. It takes time for the things of the
spirit to crystalise so these meditations will become tangible in
their lives after a length of time of use.
