alike. I find favour with people and they commit to my
hand men and resources because the Lord is with me,
and all that I do, the Lord makes it to prosper. (Gen
39:21-23 NKJV paraphrased, some additions mine).

God gives me favour in the sight of all the people: and
it shall come to pass, that, when I go, I shall not go
empty: But I am given money, silver, gold, clothings,
cars, lands, houses, and resources. Thus, I receive the
wealth of the people. (Ex 3:21-22 NKJV paraphrased,
some additions mine).
