Kings, leaders, great and wealthy persons plead for me to
stand before them and they seek my audience for I have
found favour in their sight. (1 Sam. 16:22 KJV paraphrased).

I please kings, leaders, great and wealthy men. I find
favour in their sight so that they send and equip me with
